# 🏛️ Cluaiz Pure Token-to-Token Billing Architecture
Professional SaaS Logic: **Base Rate vs. Sell Rate**

Is document me humne Cluaiz ke billing system ka ek-ek point aur file reference detail me samjhaya hai.

---

## 1. Request Flow (Step-by-Step)
Jab AI koi task karta hai, toh ye flow follow hota hai:

1.  **Trigger (AI Engine)**: Python side se AI task complete hota hai aur Backend ([UsageService](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/services/usage.service.ts#14-271)) ko usage details (Tokens + Skill Name) bheji jaati hain.
2.  **Lookup (Backend)**: System `UsageService.ts` me check karta hai:
    - Kya ye **AI Chat** hai? -> [model_pricing.config.ts](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/config/model_pricing.config.ts) se rate lega.
    - Kya ye **Agent Skill** hai? -> [skills.config.ts](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/config/skills.config.ts) se category dekh kar [billing.config.ts](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/config/billing.config.ts) se rate lega.
3.  **Calculation**: Usage ko rate aur profit margin se multiply kiya jata hai.
4.  **Deduction (Database)**: User ki `Organization` collection me `tokensUsed` increment hota hai aur Wallet se tokens minus hote hain.

---

## 2. File-by-File Technical Role

### 📂 [Backend/src/config/model_pricing.config.ts](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/config/model_pricing.config.ts)
**Role**: AI "Brain" (Gemini/OpenAI/Ollama) ki pricing manage karna.
*   **Base Rate**: Provider ka asli cost per 1M tokens.
*   **Margin**: 1.50 (50% Profit Markup).
*   **calculateTokensToBurn**: Ye function tokens nikalne ka master formula hai.

### 📂 [Backend/src/config/skills.config.ts](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/config/skills.config.ts)
**Role**: Agent ki specialist "Skills" ko categories me baantna.
*   Maps all 20+ skills from [agents-data.ts](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Frontend/src/lib/agents-data.ts) to 4 key categories:
    - `SKILL_OUTREACH` (Sales/Marketing)
    - `SKILL_ANALYSIS` (Data/Audit)
    - `SKILL_AUTOMATION` (Operations/Refunds)
    - `SKILL_NAVIGATION` (Support/Teleport)

### 📂 [Backend/src/config/billing.config.ts](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/config/billing.config.ts)
**Role**: Global infrastructure costs aur Skill-category rates store karna.
*   **TOKEN_BURN_RATES**: Categories ke fixed rates (e.g. Outreach = 500 Tnk).
*   **WEB_SEARCH**: Google Search ka constant rate (500 Tnk).
*   **STORAGE_RENT_CONFIG**: MBs ke hisaab se daily token deduction ka logic.

### 📂 [Backend/src/services/usage.service.ts](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/services/usage.service.ts)
**Role**: Billing ka **"Engine"**.
*   [trackActivity()](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/services/usage.service.ts#38-162): Ye main function hai jo tokens ko DB me save karta hai.
*   [trackSkillUsage()](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/services/usage.service.ts#177-185): Skill ka naam dekh kar automatic sahi category ki fee kaatta hai.

---

## 3. Profit & Logic Breakdown

### 💎 AI Usage Logic (Variable)
> [(Input + Output Tokens) * (Base Rate * 1.5 Markup)](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Frontend/src/components/browser-voice/BrowserTTS.ts#365-375)
- Yahan token count fix nahi hota, isiliye hum usage-based multiply karte hain.
- **Profit**: 50% Markup = 33% Net Profit on every chat.

### 🛠️ Skill Execution Logic (Fixed)
> `Skill Category Fee (e.g. 500) * MARKUP_FACTOR fallback`
- Yahan hum "Action" ki value bill karte hain. WhatsApp msg bhejna 500 tokens ka "Service Charge" hai.
- **Profit**: Isme cost nahi hai (except compute), toh poora amount tumhara profit hai.

---

## 4. Why 1.5 Markup = 33% Profit? (Math Check)
*   **Cost**: 100 Tokens (Base).
*   **Markup**: 50% (Multiply by 1.5).
*   **Sell Price**: 150 Tokens.
*   **Total Profit**: 50 Tokens.
*   **Profit % Calculation**: [(Profit 50 / Sell 150) * 100 = 33.33%](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Frontend/src/components/browser-voice/BrowserTTS.ts#365-375).

---

## 5. UI Implementation
*   **Billing Calculator**: [BillingCalculator.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Frontend/src/app/dashboard/settings/billing/components/BillingCalculator.tsx) me exactly yahi 1.5 (50%) wala logic apply kiya hai taaki user ko transparent simulation dikhe.
*   **Activity Logs**: Backend [ActivityLog](file:///c:/Users/Aryan/my/cluaiz/Backend/src/models/ActivityLog.ts#41-48) model me har burn ko logic ke saath save karta hai taaki analytics clear rahe.
